  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Collaboration Programme - Phase V (ICP V)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Collaboration Programme Phase V (ICP V)  is a continous support to higher educational institutions with thematic focused interventions on strengthening food system and climate change adaptation. The programme will be implemented in partnership of two local universities - Hawassa and Mekelle Universities, and NMBU.</narrative>
  </description>
